111 -> connection refused
110 -> timed out
 11 -> timed out
101 -> network unreachable
104 -> the connection was broken by the peer
 32 -> the connection was broken by the peer
 98 -> the address is already in use
  2 -> no such host
  5 -> system error 5
 38 -> this build cannot resolve host names; use a literal IP address
bind a port in use: the address is already in use
connect to a closed port: connection refused
a read with nothing coming: timed out
wait says something is there: false
writing to a dead peer: the connection was broken by the peer
a reserved name is unusable: true
localhost is refused or unresolvable: true
